  "details": "Saw this product recently that lets you manually scale your arm and leg lengths via a radial menu and thought to myself \"Wait a second.. Why isn't this a VRC feature? This would be AMAZING\" \n\nWe all know that everyone's proportions are different, and not every avatar can accommodate that without having to manually edit it for yourself in blender. If this was built in it would make different avatars feel so much better to wear.\n\nhttps://nanochip.gumroad.com/l/avatarlimbscaling",
